context as @guidelines
    Use only the supplied notes and clarifications.
    Keep explicit decisions, action items, owners, and deadlines.
    Mark missing information as unresolved; do not invent commitments.

ask "Paste the meeting notes." as @notes
if @notes is an empty string
    return "Meeting notes are required."

do Extract decisions and action items from @notes following @guidelines as @actions

if @actions includes action items with missing owners or deadlines
    print List the missing owners and deadlines in @actions.
    ask "Provide the missing details, or say leave unresolved." as @clarification
    do Update @actions using @clarification and @guidelines as @actions

print Turn @actions into a concise meeting follow-up, keeping unresolved items visible.
